 Returns reserved stock back to available. Used when an order is cancelled.
 
+### restockStock [productId: ProductId, quantity: number] => void | error: String
+Adds returned items back to available stock; reserved is unchanged. Used when a refunded order's items are back in the warehouse. Fails if product not found.
