@@ -14,13 +14,18 @@ Charges the customer for an order. Reads order total from Orders to verify amoun
 ### getPaymentStatus [paymentId: PaymentId] => PaymentStatus
 Returns current payment status (pending, completed, failed).
 
+### refund [paymentId: PaymentId] => void | error: String
+Refunds a completed payment for a returned order and puts each order item's quantity back into available stock. Fails if payment not found or not completed.
+
 ## operational principle
 after processPayment(orderId, amount)
   => getPaymentStatus(paymentId) == "completed"
 
 ## interactions
 - Reads the order total through `Orders.getOrderTotal()`
+- On refund, reads order items through `Orders.getOrder()` and restocks them through `Inventory.restockStock()`
 - The Orders repository and Inventory internals are private to those concepts, so Payments does not import them
 
 ## dependencies
-- Orders: read-only via getOrderTotal()
+- Orders: read-only via getOrderTotal(), getOrder()
+- Inventory: restock via restockStock()
